      "updated": 1788929319740,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Contains both abstract and non\nabstract methods .\n\n2. Its variable are by default ->\ndefault , non-static and non final . We\ncan change this behaviour .\n\n3. It can contain constructor .\n\n4. Methods has to explicitly declared\nas abstract .\n\n5. Cannot be instantiate .\n\n6. Its reference can be created .\n\n7. Mainly used for run time\npolymorphism .",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Contains both abstract and non abstract methods .\n\n2. Its variable are by default -> default , non-static and non final . We can change this behaviour .\n\n3. It can contain constructor .\n\n4. Methods has to explicitly declared as abstract .\n\n5. Cannot be instantiate .\n\n6. Its reference can be created .\n\n7. Mainly used for run time polymorphism .",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
