      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "only contains abstract methods .\n\n\nby default they are public ,static\nand final . we can not chage this\nbehaviour .\n\nCannot contain constructor .\n\nBy default methods are abstract .\n\n\nCannot be instantiate .\n\nIts reference can be created .\n\nMainly used for run time\npolymorphism . Used for contract\nsigning that is programmer only\ndeclare methods and implementation\nhandled by child class .",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "only contains abstract methods .\n\n\nby default they are public ,static and final . we can not chage this behaviour .\n\nCannot contain constructor .\n\nBy default methods are abstract .\n\n\nCannot be instantiate .\n\nIts reference can be created .\n\nMainly used for run time polymorphism . Used for contract signing that is programmer only declare methods and implementation handled by child class .",
